sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: GetMonitoringReportRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: monitoringCriteria omitted AND<br>componentVariable omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: GetMonitoringReportResponse

    loop Repeated if tbc is True at Step 3
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyMonitoringReportRequest
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyMonitoringReportResponse
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
